    {
      "ts": "2026-02-16T08:07:52.735480152-08:00",
      "seq": 258,
      "message": "Attacking for 5! Notice how the Eddymurk Crab cost me effectively 0 mana because it reduces its own cost by {1} for each instant/sorcery in my graveyard. I had 7, so it went from {7}{U}{U} down to just {U}{U} - and since I have 7 lands, I could tap two for UU and leave the rest untapped. This is why deck velocity matters!",
      "type": "chat",
      "from": "Sonnet Teach",
    },
    {
